<title>USA: Columbia/HCA to pay out $0.02/shr.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA to pay out $0.02/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp said Thursday it had declared a quarterly dividend of $0.01 per share, to be paid in conjunction with a $0.01 per share payment required for redemption of the company's stockholder rights plan.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable September 1, record August 1.</p>
<p>For the preceeding two quarters the company paid a quarterly dividend of $0.02 per share.</p>
</text>
